# =============================================================================
# `.env` — base defaults, loaded first regardless of NODE_ENV.
#
# Backend URL is INTENTIONALLY not set here. The env-specific files own it:
#   • `.env.development`  → loaded by `yarn start`
#   • `.env.production`   → loaded by `yarn build` (including the Android APK)
# This guarantees a production build can never accidentally bake a dev URL.
#
# Anything here applies to every build.
# =============================================================================
